@startuml
title Campaign State Diagram

state "Idle" as Idle
Idle : entry / Assign manager and staff
Idle : do / Wait for approval

state "Awaiting Approval" as AwaitingApproval
AwaitingApproval : entry / Manager and staff assigned
AwaitingApproval : do / Wait for contract signing

state "Activated" as Activated
Activated : entry / Contract signed
Activated : do / Prepare adverts

state "Preparing Adverts" as PreparingAdverts
PreparingAdverts : entry / Activate campaign
PreparingAdverts : do / Approve and schedule adverts

state "Running Campaign" as RunningCampaign
RunningCampaign : entry / Adverts approved and scheduled
RunningCampaign : do / Run adverts

state "Extending or Adjusting Campaign" as ExtendingOrAdjustingCampaign
ExtendingOrAdjustingCampaign : entry / Campaign running
ExtendingOrAdjustingCampaign : do / Extend or adjust campaign

state "Completed" as Completed
Completed : entry / All adverts finished
Completed : do / Prepare final statement

state "Paid" as Paid
Paid : entry / Full amount paid
Paid : do / Mark campaign as paid

state "Archived" as Archived
Archived : entry / Campaign completed
Archived : do / Release assigned staff and managers

Idle --> AwaitingApproval : Manager and staff assigned
AwaitingApproval --> Activated : Contract signed
Activated --> PreparingAdverts : Activate campaign
PreparingAdverts --> RunningCampaign : Adverts approved and scheduled
RunningCampaign --> ExtendingOrAdjustingCampaign : Campaign running
ExtendingOrAdjustingCampaign --> RunningCampaign : Extend or adjust campaign
RunningCampaign --> Completed : All adverts finished
Completed --> Paid : Full amount paid
Paid --> Archived : Mark campaign as paid
Completed --> Archived : Prepare final statement

Archived --> [*]

@enduml
